        <mxCell id="B7bry8Y8BCtekwPN95vd-14" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;[4 A] Create attestation request, &lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;fill RESULT.IN_DATA&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;- locks a row in RESULT table&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- gets input data from Config table (with same&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;server_id)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;- computes attestation request data in json format (e.g. nonce, IBM attestation request binary and protection key)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;- saves attestation request data on column &lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;RESULT.in_data&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;- sets the row status to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;QUEUED (or FAILED)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
